### Notion setup 1/2: Get code
# 1. Get client ID for the Exnota Notion Integration (see relevant vault)
# 2. Add it to this URL: https://api.notion.com/v1/oauth/authorize?client_id={{notionOauthClientId}}&response_type=code&owner=user&redirect_uri=https%3A%2F%2Fexnota.com%2Fapi%2Fintegration%2Fnotion%2Fmobile-code-redirect
# 3. Open in browser AND START CAPTURING NETWORK REQUESTS
# 4. Go through flow, and get code from attempted redirect
#    (won't actually redirect due to exnota:// scheme).

### Fetch page (doesn't include children)
curl 'https://api.notion.com/v1/pages/171944fbb2bc8034838af33758b0aedb' \
  -H 'Notion-Version: 2022-06-28' \
  -H 'Authorization: Bearer '"{{notionAccessToken}}"''

### Fetch block children (can be used to get page's content)
curl 'https://api.notion.com/v1/blocks/171944fbb2bc8034838af33758b0aedb/children?page_size=100' \
  -H 'Authorization: Bearer '"{{notionAccessToken}}"'' \
  -H "Notion-Version: 2022-06-28"

### Delete block
curl -X DELETE 'https://api.notion.com/v1/blocks/171944fb-b2bc-8098-8bc7-ea1d22de7bdf' \
  -H 'Authorization: Bearer '"{{notionAccessToken}}"'' \
  -H 'Notion-Version: 2022-06-28'

### Get bot
curl -X GET 'https://api.notion.com/v1/users/me' \
  -H 'Authorization: Bearer '"{{notionAccessToken}}"'' \
  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
  -H 'Notion-Version: 2022-06-28'